OL,3,GNEWSAMeeting aims to address bus travel
OL,4,Aconcerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FBus routes and timetable changes are to
OL,7,Fbe discussed in a meeting after the
OL,8,Fcurrent arrangements caused
OL,9,F"unnecessary problems".
OL,11,FBus Users Guernsey said the meeting on
OL,12,FSaturday, at St Martin's Community
OL,13,FCentre at 15:00 BST, was open to
OL,14,Fmembers of the public, the bus
OL,15,Foperator, Environment & Infrastructure
OL,16,Fand deputies.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
