OL,3,GNEWSAMeeting aims to address bus travel
OL,4,Aconcerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said a month had passed since
OL,7,FGuernsey's bus routes and timetable
OL,8,Fwere changed and it had been three
OL,9,Fweeks since operator, Stagecoach,
OL,10,Fassured issues would be fixed by the
OL,11,Fend of September but "unnecessary
OL,12,Fproblems remain and our members doubt
OL,13,Fwhen they will be resolved".
OL,15,FThe meeting allows bus users to give
OL,16,Ffeedback to representatives of
OL,17,FStagecoach and the States.
